[3.316102, "o", "\r\n    Support show (FEATURE_BRCTL_SHOW) [Y/n/?] y\r\ndnsd (10 kb) (DNSD) [Y/n/?] y\r\nether-wake (5.2 kb) (ETHER_WAKE) [Y/n/?] y\r\nftpd (30 kb) (FTPD) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Enable -w (upload commands) (FEATURE_FTPD_WRITE) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Enable workaround for RFC-violating clients (FEATURE_FTPD_ACCEPT_BROKEN_LIST) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Enable authentication (FEATURE_FTPD_AUTHENTICATION) [Y/n/?] y\r\nftpget (7.9 kb) (FTPGET) [Y/n/?] y\r\nftpput (7.6 kb) (FTPPUT) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Enable long options in ftpget/ftpput (FEATURE_FTPGETPUT_LONG_OPTIONS) [Y/n] y\r\nhostname (5.8 kb) (HOSTNAME) [Y/n/?] y\r\n"]
